#NEXUS

[ sethapanichsakul2026a_fig14: Panel b, read by eye. EUHELOPODIDAE, on a grey box spanning exactly one clade, is kept as an internal label. Polytomies: Euhelopodidae (Gobititan, Huanghetitan ruyangensis, the rest) and ‘Paluxysaurus’-Sauroposeidon-Europatitan. Neither panel can be cut out by a rectangle alone: panel b is taken, and its region's lower-left corner holds the ends of panel a's DIAMANTINASAURIA and TITANOSAURIA labels. 23 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 3 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 7 case (census 2, seed 20261241). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

